{"id":"n54991-2-8","stage":5,"title":"멍들다 · 受打击","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n54991-2-8-1","ko":"여자 친구와 헤어진 다음에는 어떻게 지냈니?","zh":"和女朋友分手之后你是怎么过的？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"여자","meaning":"女性（여자 친구 合指“女朋友”）","explanation":"여자：女性（여자 친구 合指“女朋友”）。","readings":[{"term":"여자","audio":"/audio/3109db6ce062c8633018.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27369","senseId":"3","lemma":"여자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"여자","audio":"/audio/3109db6ce062c8633018.mp3"}},{"text":"친구와","meaning":"朋友，好友， 友人，故旧","explanation":"친구：朋友，好友， 友人，故旧；와：连接共同参与或比较的对象，常表示“和、与”；结合句中动作理解。","readings":[{"term":"친구","audio":"/audio/1202aff936337891e079.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29742","senseId":"1","lemma":"친구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"친구와","audio":"/audio/c93e8af68adb1e2b77e3.mp3"}},{"text":"헤어진","meaning":"分手，分开，走开","explanation":"헤어지다：分手，分开，走开；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"헤어지다","audio":"/audio/55df2acaad2147f202aa.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58271","senseId":"2","lemma":"헤어지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"헤어진","audio":"/audio/5211997f96a84253c302.mp3"}},{"text":"다음에는","meaning":"以后，下次","explanation":"다음：以后，下次；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"다음","audio":"/audio/aef613c6612d424ab454.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64531","senseId":"5","lemma":"다음","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다음에는","audio":"/audio/fee618b8e76ee2472984.mp3"}},{"text":"어떻게","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어떻게","audio":"/audio/64e493d09f1b306ade0c.mp3"}},{"text":"지냈니?","meaning":"度过","explanation":"지내다：度过；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"지내다","audio":"/audio/d56e2e0e23cd1763208c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17173","senseId":"4","lemma":"지내다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지냈니","audio":"/audio/9e2928b8baccae422a4d.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"3109db6ce062c863","term":"여자","zh":"女性（여자 친구 合指“女朋友”）","audio":"/audio/3109db6ce062c8633018.mp3","entryId":"27369","definition":"女性（여자 친구 合指“女朋友”）","pronunciation":["여자"]},{"id":"1202aff936337891","term":"친구","zh":"朋友，好友， 友人，故旧","audio":"/audio/1202aff936337891e079.mp3","entryId":"29742","definition":"关系亲近而交往甚密的人。","pronunciation":["친구"]},{"id":"55df2acaad2147f2","term":"헤어지다","zh":"分手，分开，走开","audio":"/audio/55df2acaad2147f202aa.mp3","entryId":"58271","definition":"和亲近的人切断关系。","pronunciation":["헤어지다"]},{"id":"aef613c6612d424a","term":"다음","zh":"以后，下次","audio":"/audio/aef613c6612d424ab454.mp3","entryId":"64531","definition":"一段时间后。","pronunciation":["다음"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]},{"id":"d56e2e0e23cd1763","term":"지내다","zh":"度过","audio":"/audio/d56e2e0e23cd1763208c.mp3","entryId":"17173","definition":"经过一定的时间。","pronunciation":["지ː내다"]}],"audio":"/audio/aae15f81e5062cf0efdd.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n54991-2-8-2","ko":"이별의 아픔을 겪으면서 내 가슴은 멍들었었지.","zh":"在经历分手的痛苦时，我的心也受到了极大的伤害。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이별의","meaning":"离别，告别","explanation":"이별：离别，告别；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"이별","audio":"/audio/56f2a16263b76a111bea.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24895","senseId":"1","lemma":"이별","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이별의","audio":"/audio/91a175b7f9f541cda1d4.mp3"}},{"text":"아픔을","meaning":"伤痛，痛楚，悲痛","explanation":"아픔：伤痛，痛楚，悲痛；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"아픔","audio":"/audio/50d1c4deb9fb02c57eb0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71260","senseId":"2","lemma":"아픔","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아픔을","audio":"/audio/91ca2c689019d7012fde.mp3"}},{"text":"겪으면서","meaning":"经历，经受","explanation":"겪다：经历，经受；으면서：表示同时进行或并列；与 도 合用可表示“同时却、尽管”。","readings":[{"term":"겪다","audio":"/audio/1fe9980f77afc5199ff7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15956","senseId":"1","lemma":"겪다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"겪으면서","audio":"/audio/093394306bbf3bca4f6c.mp3"}},{"text":"내","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내","audio":"/audio/b3378685b76ee79fd0ef.mp3"}},{"text":"가슴은","meaning":"心，心情，内心","explanation":"가슴：心，心情，内心；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"가슴","audio":"/audio/1bfa2a79f54c02d83437.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62908","senseId":"3","lemma":"가슴","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가슴은","audio":"/audio/3a8f1fc21162ce3c5b33.mp3"}},{"text":"멍들었었지.","meaning":"受打击，受创伤","explanation":"멍들다：受打击，受创伤；었었：回顾已经结束或与现在情况有区别的过去；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"멍들다","audio":"/audio/bd8847d60b3b65ce5370.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"54991","senseId":"2","lemma":"멍들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"멍들었었지","audio":"/audio/4474774092d9a5ec8bef.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"56f2a16263b76a11","term":"이별","zh":"离别，告别","audio":"/audio/56f2a16263b76a111bea.mp3","entryId":"24895","definition":"分别或分开，长时间无法相见。","pronunciation":["이ː별"]},{"id":"50d1c4deb9fb02c5","term":"아픔","zh":"伤痛，痛楚，悲痛","audio":"/audio/50d1c4deb9fb02c57eb0.mp3","entryId":"71260","definition":"精神上痛苦的感觉。","pronunciation":["아픔"]},{"id":"1fe9980f77afc519","term":"겪다","zh":"经历，经受","audio":"/audio/1fe9980f77afc5199ff7.mp3","entryId":"15956","definition":"遭遇并体验困难或重要的事。","pronunciation":["격따"]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"1bfa2a79f54c02d8","term":"가슴","zh":"心，心情，内心","audio":"/audio/1bfa2a79f54c02d83437.mp3","entryId":"62908","definition":"心理或感受。","pronunciation":["가슴"]},{"id":"bd8847d60b3b65ce","term":"멍들다","zh":"受打击，受创伤","audio":"/audio/bd8847d60b3b65ce5370.mp3","entryId":"54991","definition":"(喻义)由于某事而内心受到伤害或冲击。","pronunciation":["멍들다"]}],"audio":"/audio/7a73a7e1bbf1d6b18a4e.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.442,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=54991","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"고급","day":164,"sequenceScore":3.2687,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["和女朋友分手之后你是怎么过的？","在经历分手的痛苦时，我的心也受到了极大的伤害。","为什么你总是把头发剪得这么短？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["和女朋友分手之后你是怎么过的？","在经历分手的痛苦时，我的心也受到了极大的伤害。","为什么你总是把头发剪得这么短？"],"answer":1}]}
